                                "sense_id": "d31aea32-59d1-3c8c-8291-c74df72c7514",
                                "text": "To this study was necessarily added that of the ecclesiastical canons; and the knowledge of each must have given the clergy a great superiority, both as legislators in the witenagemot, and as magistrates in the different courts, at which it was their duty to attend."
                            }
